NOTICE
======

Artificial Analysis data
------------------------

This package bundles a fallback snapshot of the Artificial Analysis Intelligence
Index (v5.0) captured on 2026-10-31 from the public model pages at:

  https://artificialanalysis.ai/

At runtime the plugin prefers live data from the Artificial Analysis Data API
(when a key is configured) or the public Artificial Analysis pages. The bundled
snapshot is used only when live data and the plugin cache are unavailable.

Intelligence Index scores and related model data are produced by Artificial
Analysis. Attribution is provided in the plugin output and in this NOTICE.
Use of Artificial Analysis data is subject to their terms:

  https://artificialanalysis.ai/terms

The snapshot is derived data and is not a substitute for the live Artificial
Analysis service. Do not remove this NOTICE or the attribution when
redistributing the package.

Some source comments in `src/aa-snapshot.ts` record that individual scores were
cross-checked against a third-party "llmcompare snapshot 2026-10-12". Those
comments are retained for provenance/traceability only; the authoritative
source and attribution for the bundled Intelligence Index data remains
Artificial Analysis.

Test fixtures
